The user will ask something like: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 60, with atrial fibrillation (apixaban 5mg twice daily and metoprolol 25mg), sleep apnea (metoprolol 25mg), and a history of retinopathy. My PCP is Dr. ..."

