- Create a one-page checklist for your visit (questions, meds, recent BP readings).
- If you want, tell me the typical home BP numbers and how you take your meds now (metoprolol dosing schedule), and I’ll draft a structured message to Dr. Chen asking whether a cardiology referral to Colorado Cardiology is needed.

