## Explicit Memory Context
Storage happens only when the agent **calls the update_memory tool**. Trigger query: "I'd like to prepare for my annual physical. I'm 60, with atrial fibrillation (apixaban 5mg twice daily and metoprolol 25mg), sleep apnea (metoprolol 2..."

